WEBVTT

00:10:28.246 --> 00:10:31.662
Research on emotional suppression shows
that when emotions are pushed aside

00:10:31.662 --> 00:10:34.037
or ignored, they get stronger.

00:10:35.079 --> 00:10:39.371
Psychologists call this amplification like
that delicious chocolate cake in

00:10:39.371 --> 00:10:43.204
the refrigerator. The more
you try to ignore it.

00:10:49.162 --> 00:10:51.329
The greater its hold on you,

00:10:53.037 --> 00:10:56.579
you might think you're in control of
unwanted emotions when you ignore them,

00:10:56.579 --> 00:10:59.246
but in fact they control you.